# SCPN Reactor Kernels — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Reactor Kernels
abstract: >-
  Shared physics and geometry kernel library of the SCPN Reactor Systems
  Research Group: published closed forms, numerical integrators and the
  deterministic tessellation and export substrate used by the reactor
  device-family repositories, each with a pure-Python floor, a bit-exact
  native kernel, parity evidence and a benchmark. Computational prototypes
  only; no value describes any real machine.
